  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the mango value chain in Moundou region &quot;Route de la Mangue&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project &quot;Route de la Mangue&quot; focuses on strengthening the mango value chain in Moundou region in Chad, to decrease loss of huge volumes of mangoes, valorise production better and create sustainable and decent jobs.After an assessment was conducted on the current value chain, describing the key steps, its stakeholders, strengths and weaknesses, the outcomes of the study form the basis for interventions aiming to improve the value chain. Focus is on short-term improvements &#x2013; next mango season &#x2013; and opportunities to professionalize the mango value chain in the Moundou region in the longer term.Activities will support better management of mango orchards, decrease of post-harvest losses (e.g. by processing), valorize the mango production more, and development of a mango value chain platform to institutionalize the new knowledge and share experiences and lessons learned.</narrative>
  </description>
